      en: ["Construction began in 1952 and was completed in 1956.", "Cathedral tower height: 25 meters.", "Diocese of Yei covers 45,000 square kilometers.", "Seating capacity: 2,000 people.", "Restoration cost in 2017: $500,000.", "Number of parishes in the diocese: 18."],
